  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Booted with -e1000 (the sidecar): before bring-up the stack is on the
 NE2000, and bring-up binds the Intel card, so the view has to change.

Section: Entry

  nic-line : Text, Nic -> Text
  nic-line (tag) (n) = tag & " " & n.nic-id & " " & n.nic-name & " driver " & n.nic-driver & " mac " & n.nic-mac

  opening : [Console, Network.Read] Nothing =
    let before = nm-live-nic
    in act
      card <- net-driver-bring-up
      print-line-uni (nic-line "before" before)
      print-line-uni (nic-line "after" nm-live-nic)
      print-line-uni ("nics " & show (nm-live.nm-nic-count))
    end

